{"lyrics":"[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:12.14]Darling, I was wondering if I can\n[00:15.00]Put a yellow diamond ring on your left hand, uh\n[00:18.62]Married to that money, he's my best man\n[00:21.52]You my lover, you my fighter, you my best friend\n[00:25.56]And we in it 'til the world ends\n[00:27.84]A understatement is me calling you my girlfriend\n[00:31.42]I am married to this money, he's my best man\n[00:34.48]You my lover, you my fighter, you my best friend\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:38.90]Balling like a Laker\n[00:40.72]I'm Kobe, and you on the sideline watching\n[00:44.04]And my ex still tryna cock block it\n[00:47.20]But she can't do shit but sit back and watch it\n[00:50.08]Do you get the logic?\n[00:51.94]If I could be honest, I knew it all along\n[00:55.52]Now my mind's filled with these love songs\n[00:58.82]In your heart is where I belong\n[01:00.54]You right all of my wrongs\n[01:01.64][Chorus: Juice WRLD,\n[01:03.26]Juice WRLD & Patrick Stump\n[01:04.50]]\n[01:04.58]I was wondering if I can\n[01:06.90]Put a yellow diamond ring on your left hand, uh\n[01:10.50]Married to that money, he's my best man\n[01:13.40]You my lover, you my fighter, you my best friend\n[01:17.44]And we in it 'til the world ends\n[01:19.74]A understatement is me calling you my girlfriend\n[01:23.34]I am married to this money, he's my best man\n[01:26.38]You my lover, you my fighter, you my best friend (Best friend)\n[Verse 2: Patrick Stump]\n[01:30.30]Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh\n[01:32.04]And while the world falls apart\n[01:40.84]Still driven on your broken heart\n[01:44.26]Trash and fire falling down\n[01:48.02]As we slow dance\n[01:50.42]To that sound (To that sound), to that sound (To that sound)\n[01:54.16]And I did it all just because\n[01:56.00]To that sound (To that sound), to that sound (To that sound)\n[01:57.86]And I did it all for love, yeah\n[01:59.14][Chorus: Juice WRLD,\n[01:59.58]Patrick Stump\n[01:59.96]&\n[02:02.16]Juice WRLD & Patrick Stump\n[02:03.32]]\n[02:03.